{"type":"message","id":"03be3864","parentId":"40bc4fb3","timestamp":"2026-02-18T15:23:10.689Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is puzzling. The exec commands are returning no output. Let me try a different approach - perhaps the AgentHr folder isn't in the current directory but elsewhere. The user mentioned \"AgentHr/slide-gen\" which suggests there's a folder structure. Since I'm in D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw\\workspace-social, maybe AgentHr is at a higher level. Let me try to search from the workspace root.\n\nAlternatively, maybe I'm misinterpreting - perhaps \"AgentHr\" is a skill or package name rather than an actual folder. Let me check the TOOLS.md file for more information.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_559457478b0c4438847bb2a4","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"TOOLS.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":12451,"output":302,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12753,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771428184169}}
{"type":"message","id":"789488c7","parentId":"03be3864","timestamp":"2026-02-18T15:23:10.715Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_559457478b0c4438847bb2a4","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# TOOLS.md - Local Notes\n\nSkills define _how_ tools work. This file is for _your_ specifics — the stuff that's unique to your setup.\n\n## What Goes Here\n\nThings like:\n\n- Camera names and locations\n- SSH hosts and aliases\n- Preferred voices for TTS\n- Speaker/room names\n- Device nicknames\n- Anything environment-specific\n\n## Examples\n\n```markdown\n### Cameras\n\n- living-room → Main area, 180° wide angle\n- front-door → Entrance, motion-triggered\n\n### SSH\n\n- home-server → 192.168.1.100, user: admin\n\n### TTS\n\n- Preferred voice: \"Nova\" (warm, slightly British)\n- Default speaker: Kitchen HomePod\n```\n\n## Why Separate?\n\nSkills are shared. Your setup is yours. Keeping them apart means you can update skills without losing your notes, and share skills without leaking your infrastructure.\n\n---\n\nAdd whatever helps you do your job. This is your cheat sheet.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1771428190713}}
